/* EMV Contact Book 3 v4.4 (October 2022), Annex A Tables 37/38 and
 * Annex C Tables 48/51/52. No Contactless kernel or proprietary tag sets.
 * Single dictionary for tag constants, schemas and semantic codec bindings.
 * Intentionally no include guard: define EMV_BEGIN, EMV_TAG and EMV_END.
 * EMV_TAG(scope, name, size, byte1, byte2, min, max, length_step, kind, argument)
 * SIZE_MAX means the dictionary gives no context-independent upper bound.
 * Key-dependent certificate/remainder sizes need application-level checks.
 */
